    {
      "id": "vu9b0mo",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "9.3 Kerala Model of Development"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "nbeiksz",
      "content": "The 'Kerala Model' refers to the unique combination of high human development indicators (literacy, health, gender equality) achieved at relatively low per capita income. Key pillars:"
    },
    {
      "id": "iyvychy",
      "type": "table",
      "rows": [
        {
          "isHeader": true,
          "cells": [
            "<p><strong>Pillar</strong></p>",
            "<p><strong>Elements</strong></p>",
            "<p><strong>Outcome</strong></p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Education</p>",
            "<p>Universal primary education, high school enrollment, literacy campaigns</p>",
            "<p>93.91% literacy; first literate state</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Health</p>",
            "<p>Public health infrastructure, PHCs, community health workers (ASHAs, Kudumbashree)</p>",
            "<p>Lowest IMR, MMR; highest life expectancy</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Land Reform</p>",
            "<p>Kerala Land Reforms Act 1963; ceiling on landholding</p>",
            "<p>Reduction in inequality; peasant rights</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Decentralization</p>",
            "<p>People's Plan Campaign (1996); 35-40% state budget to local bodies</p>",
            "<p>Participatory democracy; bottom-up planning</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Women Empowerment</p>",
            "<p>Kudumbashree (1998); self-help groups; microfinance</p>",
            "<p>2 lakh+ SHGs; women entrepreneurship</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>NRI Remittances</p>",
            "<p>40 lakh+ Keralites abroad (Gulf, USA, Europe)</p>",
            "<p>Highest remittance state; consumption-led growth</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Social Movements</p>",
            "<p>Sree Narayana Guru, Ayyankali reforms; NSS, SNDP</p>",
            "<p>Caste equality; social mobility</p>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
